  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Fold Club",
      "description": "Clocked out? One quick round.\n\nFold Club is a pocket arcade: a dozen-plus minigames that are over in two or three minutes. Kill time on your own, or settle the score with friends.\n\nCHUNKY 3D MACHINES\n• Claw Machine: five coins, a messy pile of plushies. Line up the shadow, then drop.\n• Night Pinball: fire the marble, tilt your phone, and watch it really drift.\n• Bar Slide: push the mug and let go. Stop closest to the coaster, or send it off the end of the bar.\n• Snake: a board you can play on both sides. Dive into a hole to come out on the other one.\n• Crate Stacker, Clock-In Dash, Boss Alert… every cabinet is a little 3D model.\n\nSHARP EYES, FAST HANDS\n• Spot the Swap: two cabinets. What changed?\n• Cash Counter: a stack of bills with fakes mixed in. How many can you count in fifteen seconds?\n• To-Do Smasher and Whack a Jerk: clear out today’s to-dos, and today’s jerks.\n• Slipper vs. Roaches: a slipper for the ones on the floor, a quick swat for the ones that take off.\n• Boss Snowball Fight: the company trip made it to the snow, and that’s your boss across the field. Line up, throw, then move. Most hits in 60 seconds wins.\n\nBETTER ON IPHONE DUO\n• Angle Master: asked for 87 degrees? Fold your phone to exactly that, by feel.\n• Mosquito Clap: the moment it lands, snap your phone shut.\n• Sneak Peek: open to start the clock, close when you think time is up.\n• Slipper vs. Roaches: when one takes off, snap your phone shut to clap it.\n• Snake: one side on each screen. Fold shut and the snake burrows straight through to the other.\n• Half open on a table, the screen splits around the hinge: one half to watch, one half to press.\nEvery other game plays on any iPhone or iPad.\n\nPLAY ONLINE\nOpen a table and share its four-digit code. 2 to 4 players at one table, the host picks a game, everyone plays the exact same level, and the top score takes the round. Every game has a Game Center leaderboard.\n\nALSO\n• Four games on Apple Watch.\n• On devices with Apple Intelligence, the bartender has a freshly made remark about your score.\n• English and Traditional Chinese.\n\nPRO\nFree to download, with most games ready to play. Pro is a one-time purchase (not a subscription) that unlocks the Pro-only games and online play, and removes the ads in the lobby. Family Sharing supported.\n\nMore minigames are on the way.",
      "releaseNotes": "• You asked, so here it is: a new free snowball game, Boss Snowball Fight. The company trip made it to the snow, and that’s your boss across the field. Slide on the trackpad to move, tap the red dot to throw. You only hit him from directly opposite, which is exactly where he can hit you, and the snowman in the middle blocks shots from both sides. Most hits in 60 seconds wins. With Pro, you can pick it in online play too.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fold-club/id6833069611?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
