      "version": "1.1.0",
      "releaseNotes": "• New game, Slipper vs. Roaches: tap the floor to whack with a slipper, and swat the ones that take off. On iPhone Duo, snapping the phone shut swats too.\n• Fixed Whack a Jerk freezing with no result screen after you hit a third Ally.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-13T02:21:54Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "releaseNotes": "• New Pro game, Snake: a 3D board you can play on both sides. Dive into a hole to come out on the other one. On iPhone Duo, fold shut and the snake burrows straight through to the other screen.\n• Play Online now uses room codes: open a table, share the four-digit code, and your friends are in. No more waiting for a match.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-16T05:45:52Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3.0",
      "releaseNotes": "• You asked, so here it is: a new free snowball game, Boss Snowball Fight. The company trip made it to the snow, and that’s your boss across the field. Slide on the trackpad to move, tap the red dot to throw. You only hit him from directly opposite, which is exactly where he can hit you, and the snowman in the middle blocks shots from both sides. Most hits in 60 seconds wins. With Pro, you can pick it in online play too.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-22T15:09:03Z"
    }
  ],
